  "description": "NUNTAT crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C42 H90 Dy6 N12 O36,6(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.727-3.727 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.97-111.50°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C54H108Dy6N18O36. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
